{"id":"wb-7-794","name":"李庄文庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"李庄文庙","text":"李庄文庙，位于中华人民共和国山西省长治市潞城区黄牛蹄乡李庄村西，中国罕见、村级文庙、金代遗构、国保单位。\n1999年，李庄文庙公布为第三批长治市文物保护单位。2013年3月5日，李庄文庙公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%8E%E5%BA%84%E6%96%87%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94598258,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94598258","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c72fd91ba8e22dacc7ced39e.jpg","title":"20260405_Lizhuang_Confucian_Temple_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260405_Lizhuang_Confucian_Temple_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/20260405_Lizhuang_Confucian_Temple_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​潞城 李庄文庙","width":320,"height":213}}